{"seq":2,"slug":"rope-variants","title":"变体：二维、轴向与多模态 RoPE","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/rotary-embeddings/practice/rope-variants","wordCount":1350,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"变体-二维-轴向与多模态-rope\">变体：二维、轴向与多模态 RoPE</h1><p>原始 RoPE 是为一维文本序列设计的——位置就是一个整数下标。可一张图像有行有列、一段视频还多了时间轴、一个多模态输入把文本、图像、视频拼在一起。怎么把&quot;旋转编码位置&quot;推广到二维、三维乃至异构模态？这一篇梳理这条变体线，它们全都建立在 <a href=\"../mechanism/rotation-matrix\">旋转矩阵与复数视角</a> 的同一套代数上，只是把&quot;位置&quot;从标量换成了多维坐标。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-位置从标量到坐标向量\">核心概念：位置从标量到坐标向量</h2><p>一维 RoPE 给位置 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span> 施加旋转 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>m</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。推广的关键洞察是：旋转矩阵是块对角的，各频率维度互相独立，所以可以把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d/2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord\">/2</span></span></span></span></span> 个频率维度<strong>划分成几组，每组绑定一个坐标轴</strong>。二维情形下，把维度分成两半，前一半用行坐标 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span></span> 旋转、后一半用列坐标 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span> 旋转：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>h</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mtable rowspacing=\"0.16em\" columnalign=\"center center\" columnspacing=\"1em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><msubsup><mi>R</mi><mi>h</mi><mtext>(前 d/2 维)</mtext></msubsup></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><msubsup><mi>R</mi><mi>w</mi><mtext>(后 d/2 维)</mtext></msubsup></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{(h,w)} = \\begin{pmatrix} R_h^{\\text{(前 d/2 维)}} &amp; \\\\ &amp; R_w^{\\text{(后 d/2 维)}} \\end{pmatrix}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0385em;vertical-align:-0.3552em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.5198em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3552em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3em;vertical-align:-1.25em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6548em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.6548em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.0448em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3987em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2198em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">前</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"> d/2 </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">维</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3013em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.0448em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1548em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6548em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.6548em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.0448em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.0448em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.5834em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2198em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">后</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"> d/2 </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">维</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1166em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1548em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>于是两个 patch 的注意力打分自然依赖它们的<strong>二维相对位移</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>h</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>h</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(h_1-h_2,\\ w_1-w_2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，把一维 RoPE 的相对性质（<a href=\"../mechanism/relative-property\">相对位置性质</a>）无缝抬到了二维。这就是二维 RoPE（也叫 axial RoPE）的骨架，被用于视觉 Transformer 和扩散模型的骨干。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[&quot;位置表示&quot;] --&gt; B{模态}&#10;  B --&gt;|文本 1D| C[&quot;标量 m → R_m&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt;|图像 2D| D[&quot;坐标 (h,w)&lt;br/&gt;维度分两组各绑一轴&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt;|视频/多模态 3D| E[&quot;(t,h,w) 三段索引&quot;]&#10;  D --&gt; F[&quot;打分依赖二维位移 (Δh,Δw)&quot;]&#10;  E --&gt; G[&quot;M-RoPE: 文本用时间轴&lt;br/&gt;视觉用 t/h/w&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt; H[统一的旋转代数]&#10;  F --&gt; H&#10;  G --&gt; H\">flowchart TD\n  A[\"位置表示\"] --&gt; B{模态}\n  B --&gt;|文本 1D| C[\"标量 m → R_m\"]\n  B --&gt;|图像 2D| D[\"坐标 (h,w)&lt;br/&gt;维度分两组各绑一轴\"]\n  B --&gt;|视频/多模态 3D| E[\"(t,h,w) 三段索引\"]\n  D --&gt; F[\"打分依赖二维位移 (Δh,Δw)\"]\n  E --&gt; G[\"M-RoPE: 文本用时间轴&lt;br/&gt;视觉用 t/h/w\"]\n  C --&gt; H[统一的旋转代数]\n  F --&gt; H\n  G --&gt; H</pre><h2 id=\"二维-rope-与视觉-transformer\">二维 RoPE 与视觉 Transformer</h2><p>标准 ViT 用可学习绝对位置编码，一旦推理分辨率与训练不同，位置编码就要插值、效果打折。二维 RoPE 天然解决这个问题：因为它编码的是 patch 间的相对位移，换分辨率只是换了坐标范围，相对结构不变，因此对分辨率变化更鲁棒。这一优势让它进入 <a href=\"../../vision-transformers-architectures/\">视觉 Transformer 架构</a> 与扩散模型（如 FiT、部分 DiT 变体）的设计选项。轴向做法把行、列分开旋转，实现简单；也有工作用真正的二维旋转混合行列信息，表达更强但更复杂。</p>\n<h2 id=\"m-rope-多模态的多段位置\">M-RoPE：多模态的多段位置</h2><p>真正把 RoPE 推向前沿的是多模态大模型。Qwen2-VL 提出的 <strong>M-RoPE（Multimodal RoPE）</strong> 面对的难题是：一个输入里文本 token 是一维序列、图像 patch 是二维网格、视频帧还带时间维，如何用一套位置编码统一表示？</p>\n<p>M-RoPE 的做法是把位置索引拆成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>h</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(t, h, w)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 三个分量，并把 RoPE 的频率维度分成三组分别编码时间、高度、宽度。对纯文本 token，三个分量取同一个递增值（退化回一维行为，保证与文本预训练兼容）；对图像 token，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 固定、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>h</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(h,w)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 取网格坐标；对视频，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 随帧递增、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>h</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(h,w)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 取帧内坐标。这样文本、图像、视频被安放进同一个三维位置空间，跨模态的相对关系得以统一建模。Qwen2-VL、Qwen2.5-VL 的技术报告称这一设计显著改善了对高分辨率图像和长视频的理解，也为多模态外推提供了便利。</p>\n<h2 id=\"变体对照\">变体对照</h2><p>不同变体的差异，本质是&quot;位置的维度&quot;和&quot;各频率维度如何分配给坐标轴&quot;两点。下表汇总主流变体的定位。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>变体</th>\n<th>位置维度</th>\n<th>频率维度分配</th>\n<th>典型场景</th>\n<th>代表模型/工作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>原始 RoPE</td>\n<td>1D（标量）</td>\n<td>全部编码一维位置</td>\n<td>文本 LLM</td>\n<td>Llama / Qwen / Mistral</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2D / Axial RoPE</td>\n<td>2D（h,w）</td>\n<td>两组分绑行、列</td>\n<td>图像、扩散骨干</td>\n<td>ViT 变体 / FiT</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>M-RoPE</td>\n<td>3D（t,h,w）</td>\n<td>三组分绑时、高、宽</td>\n<td>图文视频多模态</td>\n<td>Qwen2-VL / 2.5-VL</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>VideoRoPE</td>\n<td>3D 强化时序</td>\n<td>时间轴分配更多低频</td>\n<td>长视频理解</td>\n<td>VideoRoPE 等 2024 工作</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>解耦 RoPE（部分维度）</td>\n<td>1D，仅部分维加 RoPE</td>\n<td>只对部分头/维旋转</td>\n<td>配合 MLA 压缩</td>\n<td>DeepSeek-V2/V3</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>最后一行值得一提：DeepSeek 的多头潜在注意力（MLA）为了压缩 KV，让一部分维度不加 RoPE、另一部分专门承载 RoPE 位置信息（解耦 RoPE），这是位置编码与 <a href=\"../../kv-cache-optimization/\">KV 缓存优化</a> 协同设计的典型案例。</p>\n<h2 id=\"一个统一的视角\">一个统一的视角</h2><p>尽管变体繁多，它们没有一个改动了 RoPE 的核心代数——都是&quot;把某个坐标乘上频率得到角度、再用旋转作用于 Q/K&quot;。区别只在于位置是几维的、以及怎么把有限的频率维度分给各坐标轴。理解了 <a href=\"../mechanism/frequency-bands\">频率带与波长</a> 里&quot;每个维度是一把不同精度的尺子&quot;，就能明白 M-RoPE 不过是把这些尺子分派给了不同的坐标轴。这种&quot;同一代数、多种投影&quot;的优雅，正是 RoPE 能横跨文本、视觉、多模态的根本原因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>变体的统一思路：把频率维度分组，每组绑定一个坐标轴，位置从标量变成坐标向量。</li>\n<li>二维/轴向 RoPE 编码 patch 间二维位移，对分辨率变化鲁棒，用于 ViT 和扩散骨干。</li>\n<li>M-RoPE 用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>h</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(t,h,w)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 三段索引统一文本、图像、视频，纯文本退化回一维保持兼容（Qwen2-VL）。</li>\n<li>VideoRoPE 强化时序、解耦 RoPE 配合 MLA 压缩 KV，都是同一代数的不同投影。</li>\n<li>所有变体都不改 RoPE 核心——只改&quot;位置几维&quot;和&quot;频率如何分配给坐标轴&quot;。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读-跨库链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨库链接</h2><ul>\n<li>代数基础：<a href=\"../mechanism/rotation-matrix\">旋转矩阵与复数视角</a></li>\n<li>频率分配的直觉：<a href=\"../mechanism/frequency-bands\">频率带与波长</a></li>\n<li>二维相对性的来源：<a href=\"../mechanism/relative-property\">相对位置性质</a></li>\n<li>跨 hub：视觉 Transformer 架构见 <a href=\"../../vision-transformers-architectures/\">视觉 Transformer 架构</a>；解耦 RoPE 与 KV 压缩见 <a href=\"../../kv-cache-optimization/\">KV 缓存优化</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"变体：二维、轴向与多模态 RoPE","id":"变体-二维-轴向与多模态-rope"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：位置从标量到坐标向量","id":"核心概念-位置从标量到坐标向量"},{"level":2,"text":"二维 RoPE 与视觉 Transformer","id":"二维-rope-与视觉-transformer"},{"level":2,"text":"M-RoPE：多模态的多段位置","id":"m-rope-多模态的多段位置"},{"level":2,"text":"变体对照","id":"变体对照"},{"level":2,"text":"一个统一的视角","id":"一个统一的视角"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨库链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨库链接"}],"prev":{"title":"实现与内核：把旋转写成能跑对、跑快的代码","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/rotary-embeddings/practice/rope-implementation"},"next":{"title":"落地与边界：选参数、避坑、知其所短","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/rotary-embeddings/practice/rope-in-practice"}}